g scroll instead"],[1230,"**Multiline**: Set `multiline` to render a textarea instead of a single-line input"],[533,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[815,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[454,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[700,"**Page Up** / **Page Down**: larger increase or decrease when supported"],[520,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[537,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[530,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[859,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[858,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[589,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1017,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[1232,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria TextField for accessibility and behavior"],[1659,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[521,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[516,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[1381,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[1413,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1314,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[1386,"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"],[1411,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[1408,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[984,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[985,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1036,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[198,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[1442,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[1379,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1013,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[585,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[1291,"**Space / Enter**"],[864,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[197,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[633,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[988,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[515,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[525,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1042,"**Standalone** — with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[1416,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1405,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[465,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[509,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1287,"**Tab**"],[196,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[861,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[986,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[817,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1283,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1282,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1420,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[1409,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[524,"**Trade-offs:**"],[466,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[636,"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"],[1592,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based on the `as` value - `useRef<HTMLButtonElement>` works with `as=\"button\"`."],[459,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[1388,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[1617,"**Use `Grid` when**: You need explicit two-dimensional layouts with rows and columns, named grid areas, or responsive auto-fill patterns."],[527,"**Use default mode** for SSR applications or when icons appear infrequently"],[528,"**Use sprite mode** when the same icons appear many times (navigation, lists, tables)"],[538,"**Use sprite mode**: For repeated icons, consider sprite mode which consolidates multiple icons into a single SVG sprite sheet, reducing DOM size and improving performance when the same icon appears multiple times"],[1015,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with `errorMessage` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1231,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with `errorMessage` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1438,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[1380,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[1414,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[1389,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[514,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1099,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1096,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1105,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1106,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1094,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1100,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1103,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1097,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1109,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[384,"`[data-disabled]`"],[388,"`[data-focused]`"],[386,"`[data-invalid]`"],[106,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[264,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives. Locale comes from a host `<I18nProvider>`. This version has no typed/segmented entry - selection is via the calendar."],[1676,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1678,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1672,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[1674,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[1679,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[1675,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[1673,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[1677,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[1588,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[411,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[867,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[991,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[239,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"],[199,"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"],[868,"`aria-disabled` for disabled options"],[992,"`aria-disabled` for disabled segments"],[201,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[870,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1299,"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"],[993,"`aria-label` required on the container for screen readers"],[238,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[771,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[200,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[869,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[236,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[769,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[768,"`aria-valuenow` reflects the current value"],[235,"`aria-valuenow` reflects the current value (clamped to 0–100)"],[770,"`aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`)"],[237,"`aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`) via `Intl.NumberFormat`; the same string is rendered inside the circle. Override the text with the `aria-valuetext` prop, or control formatting with `formatOptions`"],[1580,"`Box` is a polymorphic layout component that renders as any HTML element or custom component via the `as` prop. It provides consistent spacing, elevation, rounding, and self-alignment within flex or grid containers."],[105,"`Calendar` values are `CalendarDate` objects. Import the date primitives you need from the `@godaddy/antares/date` subpath:"],[1339,"`className` and `style` apply to the tooltip panel."],[1549,"`colorIndex` pins each series to a palette color. Any series can use any index,\nindependently — here two pairs each share an index so an actual line and its\ndashed forecast read as the same color, distinguished only by line style."],[1046,"`Content`, `Header`, `Footer`, and `ButtonGroup` each accept all `Flex` layout props."],[803,"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `p